{{/*
Drafted act / note de synthèse — template version document_v1.

Same contract as bordereau_v1: the blocks come from the drafting step, their
STYLE has been checked against the closed allowlist in services/render.go and
their TEXT has been escaped, so nothing the model wrote reaches pandoc as
markup. A block only reaches this template once every citation it carries has
resolved (services/citations.go, ResolveOrRefuse).
*/ -}}
{{ if .DraftNotice -}}
::: {custom-style="Mention"}
{{ .DraftNotice }}
:::

{{ end -}}
{{ range .Blocks -}}
::: {custom-style="{{ .Style }}"}
{{ .Text }}
:::

{{ end -}}
{{ if .Sources -}}
::: {custom-style="Titre2"}
Sources citées
:::

{{ range .Sources -}}
::: {custom-style="Citation"}
{{ . }}
:::

{{ end -}}
{{ end -}}
::: {custom-style="PiedDePage"}
{{ .Attribution }}
:::
